  abilityId: 830758
  abilityName: Earth-Shaking Strum
  abilityDesc: 17 combo powerful Earth attack on all foes, hugely boosts Atk, Def,
    Rec and enormously boosts critical hit rate of Earth types for 3 turns, considerably
    boosts own max HP, enormously boosts own Atk for 3 turns, massive additional
    attack at turn's end for 2 turns & probability of purging Atk boost effects from
    all foes (PvP modes only)
